Unheard

The clock overlaps 4.20 in morning
But the eyes didn't.
The soul craves for sleep.
But the thoughts fight were really high.

Every corner of heart screams 
The screams were loud still unheard.
The mind is numb  
emotions were dumb 

The shivering photograph in hands 
The fluttering voice 
Was enough to manifest 
How broken the man was.